{'symbol': 'DOV', 'date': '2022-06-29 16:15:00', 'title': 'CALDERA EXPANDS STRATEGIC PARTNERSHIP WITH BARBIERI ELECTRONIC', 'text': "DOWNERS GROVE, ILL. , JUNE 29, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CALDERA, PART OF DOVER\xa0(NYSE: DOV), RECENTLY ANNOUNCED AN AGREEMENT WITH BARBIERI\xa0UNDER WHICH CALDERA WILL SERVE AS THE MASTER DISTRIBUTOR FOR ALL BARBIERI ELECTRONIC SOLUTIONS WORLDWIDE, EXPANDING ON THE BRANDS' EXISTING STRATEGIC PARTNERSHIP."}